# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NEXUS Mobile (Expo)
# Copy to apps/mobile/.env and adjust as needed. Expo loads this automatically.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# API base URL. It MUST include the /v1 path.
# Leave unset to auto-detect the host from Expo's hostUri (adds /v1 for you).
# Physical devices cannot reach "localhost" — use your computer's LAN IP.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.20:4000/v1

# Supabase sign-in (optional). Must match the API's SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_ANON_KEY.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
